Third-party data
----------------
varek/v1_4/data/public_suffix_list.dat is the Public Suffix List
(https://publicsuffix.org/), distributed under the Mozilla Public License,
v. 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/); its license header is kept in the file.
VAREK reads it to refuse wildcard host rules over shared domains.

varek/v1_4/schemas/ocsf-1.9.0/schema.json is part of the OCSF 1.9.0 schema
(https://github.com/ocsf/ocsf-schema, tag 1.9.0), compiled by the OCSF project's
compiler and cut down to the classes VAREK exports; it is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0, whose text and the project's NOTICE are kept beside it.
The tests check VAREK's OCSF events against it.
